                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your patient, a 27-year-old male, admitted on 04/10/2025 with classic signs of acute appendicitis, including right iliac fossa pain, fever, and elevated inflammatory markers. Clinical examination, abdominal ultrasound, and laboratory workup confirmed the diagnosis. The patient was kept nil by mouth, received intravenous fluids and analgesics, and underwent laparoscopic emergency appendectomy on 05/10/2025 without intraoperative complications. Histopathology confirmed acute appendicitis. Postoperative recovery was uneventful; wound healing was satisfactory, and the patient was mobilised early with physiotherapy support. Oral intake was resumed on postoperative day one. The patient was discharged home on 09/10/2025 in good general condition. Please arrange follow-up in approximately two weeks for wound inspection and review of histopathology results. Should any concerns arise, do not hesitate to contact us.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
